WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.138
Let’s walk through Red Actions.

00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:05.500
Review the complete Red action in its active move context

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:05.638
.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.175
Verify narrative, structured fields, and lifecycle state before

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.750
recording an explicit White Cell outcome.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.863
On this slide, review submitted Red Team actions before

00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:17.363
they affect the shared exercise record.

00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:20.200
In practice, check the active move, narrative,

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.525
and action details before recording the review outcome.

00:00:23.525 --> 00:00:26.000
When you are ready, use Open Red Actions to

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.688
move to the live surface.

00:00:28.185 --> 00:00:30.860
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:31.035
.
